{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Black Lagoon: Roberta's Blood Trail","Roberta, the terrorist-turned-maid that made her appearence in the first season of 'Black Lagoon', returns in this five-episode OVA series - and this time, all bets are off!\n\n\nRoberta's benefactor, the patriarch of the Lovelace clan, is murdered during a political rally.  The assassin's trail soon leads back to Roanapur - so now she has returned on a mission of vengeance!  However, close behind her is the new patriarch, Garcia, as well as Roberta's apprentice (and maid), Fabiola Iglesias.  As the body count of Roberta's bloody rampage mounts, forces from within the corrupt island (which includes the Lagoon Company), as well as overseas converge on what threatens to escalate into all-out war!"],"ja":["BLACK LAGOON Roberta's Blood Trail",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":1519,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-4901","ids":{"shikimori":4901,"mal":4901,"anilist":4901,"kodik":"serial-7488"},"kodikIds":["serial-7486","serial-78593","serial-7488"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-7486":"2019-12-03T23:59:43Z","serial-78593":"2026-10-06T00:20:32Z","serial-7488":"2020-01-21T14:49:29Z"},"title":"Пираты «Чёрной лагуны»: Кровавая тропа Роберты","originalTitle":"Black Lagoon: Roberta's Blood Trail","alt":"Пираты 'Черной Лагуны': Кровавая тропа Роберты Black Lagoon: Roberta's Blood Trail BLACK LAGOON Roberta's Blood Trail","description":"Роберта (ロベルタ), горничная-террористка, впервые появившаяся в первом сезоне « Пиратов „Чёрной Лагуны“ », возвращается в новой пятисерийной OVA. Господина Роберты, Диего Сан ] ], главу семьи ], убивают во время политического митинга. След убийцы приводит Роберту обратно в Роанапур, куда она отправляется, чтобы отомстить. Вслед за Робертой приезжает новый глава семьи — Гарсия Фернандо Лавлейс (Fernando Garcia Lovelace) и её ученица — Фабиола Иглесиас (ファビオラ・イグレシアス ). Возвращение разъярённой Роберты заставляет мобилизоваться ведущие преступные группировки города, одной из которых оказывается и компания «Лагуна». Скоро в конфликт могут вмешаться и другие силы, а это грозит уже обернуться полномасштабной войной...","year":2010,"type":"OVA","genres":["сэйнэн","Экшен","взрослые персонажи","организованная преступност"],"rating":8.03,"popularity":67278,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[1519],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/4901/236ddc7d530cc7fefe3157edc2449ab8.jpeg","width":695,"height":990},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/4901-F5KERZpTwS3T.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-7486","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/198387/dd8783c116445dfe8c90f969f65affa5/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-869","dubId":"869","label":"Субтитры","language":"ja","original":true,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-78593","translationId":"869","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1674897/6ba0ef9638f2b064d4b3eb76c28d22fe/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-767","dubId":"767","label":"SHIZA Project","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-7488","translationId":"767","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/198414/6425fa8b7bad9bd6255c35d5d9d9a950/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":nul